# ACCEPTED RISK: pillow 11.3.0 (image processing for avatars, team images, resource covers)
#
# Why not fixed: pillow 12.x, which fixes these, requires Python >= 3.10. This image uses
# Python 3.9, so pip cannot install a fixed version.
#
# Reachability: the app DOES process user-uploaded images (ImageField on avatars, team images,
# resource covers, plus imagekit and image_optimizer.py). This surface is reachable, so this
# is a genuine accepted risk, not a false positive.
#
# Mitigation and follow-up: upgrade the base image to Python 3.12, then bump pillow to 12.x.
# In the meantime, uploads are restricted to expected image types at the form/model level.
CVE-2026-25990
CVE-2026-40192
CVE-2026-42311
CVE-2026-54058
CVE-2026-54059
CVE-2026-54060
CVE-2026-55379
CVE-2026-55380
CVE-2026-59197
